<title>HUNGARY: Hungary shares close 1.85 pct up, BUX at 6,252.91.</title>
<headline>Hungary shares close 1.85 pct up, BUX at 6,252.91.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's BUX index ended officially at 6,252.91 points, up 113.82 points or 1.85 percent, unchanged from the preliminary figures.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover totalled 4.307 billion forints, compared to 6.32 billion on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
